      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} They aren't being shown, but they are being downloaded in the background and cached to disk.\n\nThe issue is it's a waste of bandwidth and it's making thousands of unnecessary cached files over time.\n\nIf custom images are turned off in Shield Levels, the expected result should be them not being downloaded at all.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
